# Prefer latest Alpine when offered

When an image is available with an **Alpine** variant, use it (smaller, fewer CVEs):

```yaml
# ✅ Prefer alpine when the publisher offers it
image: someorg/image:latest-alpine

# ❌ Avoid non-alpine when alpine exists
# image: someorg/image:latest
```

Apply when adding or editing services. Check the image’s tags on the registry for `alpine`, `-alpine`, or `latest-alpine`.
